WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.137
A shaken

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:06.206
campus, uniting in grief

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:10.577
The University of Virginia

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.579
mourning three football players.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.681
Two other students were injured

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.983
after a shooting rocked the school.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:17.884
The shootings

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.953
occurred on a bus full of students

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.622
turning from a field trip.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.858
Three of the victims did not survive

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.895
Gunshots rang out Sunday night.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.563
An intense manhunt

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:31.564
in and around

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.200
Charlottesville for the suspect followed.

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:36.603
Pardon me.

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.271
In the middle of a press conference,

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:38.872
the news

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:41.374
everyone on campus was hoping for

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.812
Thank you, Captain.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.181
We just received information.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:50.183
The suspect is in custody.

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:52.118
Police have identified the suspect

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.086
as university

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.220
of Virginia student

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.456
Christopher Darnell Jones Jr.

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:59.626
The 22 year old was a freshman on the UVA

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:03.563
football team in 2018 but did not play in

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:04.898
any games.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.900
Police said Jones was arrested

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.235
about 75 miles outside

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.271
the Charlottesville campus.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.473
The university identified the victims

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:14.274
as Devin

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.810
Chandler, Lavelle Davis Jr

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.511
and Deshawn Perry.

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.580
All current football players.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.582
Officials did not identify

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.584
the two additional students

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.252
injured in the incident.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.854
The UVA football team

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:29.389
expressed its heartbreak

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:31.057
in a tweet saying, quote,

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:33.093
There are no words to describe

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.527
this tremendous loss

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.663
to our UVA football family.

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:37.697
Their coach

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:38.231
calling them

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.666
incredible young men

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:41.468
with huge aspirations

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.536
and extremely bright futures.

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.738
A sentiment of sorrow

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.307
echoed by the University

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:49.209
of Virginia's president.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:52.412
My heart is broken for the victims

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:53.513
and their families

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.181
and for all those

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.983
who knew and loved them.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:57.717
The suspect's

00:01:57.717 --> 00:02:00.887
father told CNN affiliate W TVR.

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.523
He is heartbroken and in disbelief.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.226
I don't I don't know what to say

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:08.394
except I'm

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.530
sorry on his behalf.

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:12.932
And I apologize

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.701
Police said the suspect had come

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:15.535
to the UVA

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:17.971
police department's attention before.

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:18.538
They said

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.306
Jones had a prior incident

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:22.041
involving a concealed weapon

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.409
in 20, 21

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:25.545
outside the city of Charlottesville.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.848
UVA's Judicial Council took over the case

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.550
and the results are pending.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.385
According to police

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:34.254
During a press conference yesterday.

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:35.655
UVA's police chief

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.690
also said that in September,

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:38.258
a non

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:39.626
student claimed Jones

00:02:39.626 --> 00:02:40.560
had made a comment

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.262
about possessing a gun.

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:44.230
But to the knowledge of the police,

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:44.898
that person

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:47.400
never actually saw the gun in question.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.135
The victim's families

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:51.171
and the suspect's father shaken

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:53.373
now hoping for answers.

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:54.607
What happened?

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:56.943
Why did had to get this far?

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:57.810
He could have called me.

